6. [Remaining gates and security notes](06-next-steps.md)
7. [Historical dashboard deployment](07-dashboard.md)
8. [Current management installation](08-management-install.md)

## Historical source delivery

Pushed to `heath0xFF/mrmr`, branch `main`, at [edd8ce1](https://github.com/heath0xFF/mrmr/commit/edd8ce1357e555f468aba5d4b2a09e0514c79870). Remote `main` was checked against the local revision. The tracked worktree was clean at that push. The later README/implementation clarifications and local HTML atlas are not part of that commit.

