The public guides are [README](../README.md), [SETUP](../SETUP.md), and [IMPLEMENTATION](../IMPLEMENTATION.md).

## Important boundary

> LLM = judgment. Runtime = authority.

A successful synthetic test proves that the parts connect. It does not prove that a model makes correct decisions about real incidents. Keep real effects shadowed until a separate review supports promotion.

